    "text": "Texas\nThe Hardest Texas Towns to Pronounce, Can You Nail Them All?\nBy Stryker,\n2 hours agoTexas has over 1,200 cities and towns. Some of them have some very unique names that throw people for a loop the first time they see them. Even if you have lived in Texas your whole life, you have butchered at least one of these at some point. Heck, you might even not know you're mispronouncing some of them until right now. These are the official pronunciations according to the official city or town they came from. Let's see how well you do.",
